== Notes ==
{{anomaly|The white line that appears after casting to denote the area is closer to 480 units radius, rather than the listed 360.}}
* Each of the 24 meteors deal damage randomly around in the targeted area.
** Since each meteor has its own area, they may hit outside the skill's AoE circle if the center or a meteor's AoE is close enough to the border.
* Movement interrupts the channeling time, resulting in fewer meteors.
* The meteors will only fall within the limits of the map where player characters would be able to be (e.g: They won't fall on a slope a player can't climb or slide down from above). This can be used to narrow the spread and increase the effective damage of the skill.
* Can be precast during [[Burning Retreat]] for longer range cast, causing the channel to begin after the [[Burning Retreat]] ends. Note that Allow Skill Retargeting must be off for this to work if ground targeting is set to Instant.
* The damage reduction is additive rather than multiplicative. Meaning the second hit does 90%, third 80%, and so on, reaching the minimum on the 9th hit.
* Assuming all 24 impacts hit, it will do a total of: 
{{skill fact|damage|weapon=staff|coefficient=13.44}} in PvE
{{skill fact|damage|weapon=staff|coefficient=3.792}} in WvW 
{{skill fact|damage|weapon=staff|coefficient=9.24}} in PvP

